The '''Archaeologist's Camp''' is a sub-location of the [[Spider's Den]].

{{ZoneText|Talk to the &bArchaeologist&f.|Learn about &bRelics&f.}}

== Purpose ==
The [[Archaeologist]] is an [[NPC]] located in the '''Archaeologist's Camp'''. They give the player the [[Archaeologist's Compass]] and ask the player to find all {{Green|28}} [[Relics]]. The player with {{c|10k}} for each [[Relic]] they have found. Whilst the player looks for all of the [[Relics]], the [[Archaeologist]] will give them hints, pointing at the general location of one of the missing [[Relics]].

